{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Mecha Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from tons of loadouts and fully arm your  mecha squad. Each loadout offers a unique combat style and method of attack. Certain combinations even unlock <strong>Synergy Skills</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9c9fd6a71c3c453e8bf3eb99e48809cd.poster.avif?t=1758777222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9c9fd6a71c3c453e8bf3eb99e48809cd.webm?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9c9fd6a71c3c453e8bf3eb99e48809cd.mp4?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Mechanic Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from hundreds of unique modules and assemble them to forge a combat style that\u2019s truly your own. Whether it's ruthless firebringer, agile striker, or combat engineer, the way you fight is defined by how you assemble.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if you're lucky enough to find a growth-type module in early game and slot it into your command panel which affects all the mechs...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/37817b8bb01530dcf8e79759a6b782ca.poster.avif?t=1758777222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/37817b8bb01530dcf8e79759a6b782ca.webm?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/37817b8bb01530dcf8e79759a6b782ca.mp4?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Dynamic Events and Combat Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience various events across different disaster stages, building your understanding of the pilots and uncovering the dark secrets behind the <i>Death Ring</i>. Complete missions such as decapitation, evacuation, defense, and mining to earn rewards that can change the fate of cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9ac2e52afe56ac9cfcc27620a742c7ec.poster.avif?t=1758777222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9ac2e52afe56ac9cfcc27620a742c7ec.webm?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9ac2e52afe56ac9cfcc27620a742c7ec.mp4?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the Monster Horde</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying creatures like the vengeful Acid Lizard, explosive Poison Frog, and spiked Shiver Princer. Utilize your mecha squad's plan strategies, like raiding enemy backlines, causing chaos among elite monsters, and unleashing group bombardments to succeed. Every choice could be the key to humanity\u2019s survival.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415580?t=1758777222","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415580?t=1758777222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/32caeae0ef590a130d538b4e23d3a5171e95902a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758777222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/32caeae0ef590a130d538b4e23d3a5171e95902a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758777222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Mecha Squad</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from tons of loadouts and fully arm your  mecha squad. Each loadout offers a unique combat style and method of attack. Certain combinations even unlock <strong>Synergy Skills</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9c9fd6a71c3c453e8bf3eb99e48809cd.poster.avif?t=1758777222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9c9fd6a71c3c453e8bf3eb99e48809cd.webm?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9c9fd6a71c3c453e8bf3eb99e48809cd.mp4?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Mechanic Combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from hundreds of unique modules and assemble them to forge a combat style that\u2019s truly your own. Whether it's ruthless firebringer, agile striker, or combat engineer, the way you fight is defined by how you assemble.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What if you're lucky enough to find a growth-type module in early game and slot it into your command panel which affects all the mechs...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/37817b8bb01530dcf8e79759a6b782ca.poster.avif?t=1758777222\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/37817b8bb01530dcf8e79759a6b782ca.webm?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/37817b8bb01530dcf8e79759a6b782ca.mp4?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in Dynamic Events and Combat Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience various events across different disaster stages, building your understanding of the pilots and uncovering the dark secrets behind the <i>Death Ring</i>. Complete missions such as decapitation, evacuation, defense, and mining to earn rewards that can change the fate of cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9ac2e52afe56ac9cfcc27620a742c7ec.poster.avif?t=1758777222\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9ac2e52afe56ac9cfcc27620a742c7ec.webm?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/extras/9ac2e52afe56ac9cfcc27620a742c7ec.mp4?t=1758777222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight the Monster Horde</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face terrifying creatures like the vengeful Acid Lizard, explosive Poison Frog, and spiked Shiver Princer. Utilize your mecha squad's plan strategies, like raiding enemy backlines, causing chaos among elite monsters, and unleashing group bombardments to succeed. Every choice could be the key to humanity\u2019s survival.</p>","developers":["Rouge Mecha"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415580/header.jpg?t=1758777222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415580/1425276831/0c4b4012176ac6605c11dce42f7ac1912a39e676/1751997859/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752001292","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415580/1425276831/0c4b4012176ac6605c11dce42f7ac1912a39e676/1751997859/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752001292","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415580/1425276831/0c4b4012176ac6605c11dce42f7ac1912a39e676/1751997859/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752001292","id":257166616,"name":"EA_PV_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257166616/3c3fe9ccac32a54c626d6ef84d11dc5857578c3a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752001292"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415580/833452/dd665c298d027950c40c54b95322036072f101cb/1750848814/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740290269","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415580/833452/dd665c298d027950c40c54b95322036072f101cb/1750848814/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740290269","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3415580/833452/dd665c298d027950c40c54b95322036072f101cb/1750848814/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740290269","id":257101095,"name":"FebDemoPV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101095/f88ea02483bd9b07d45c5d9b25d626599704f39d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740290269"}],"name":"Death Ring: Second Impact","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Death R